              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Up to one unit of Milites on foot may be trained as Sagittari (archers): hand weapons, composite bows and bucklers, no further equipment. Light Infantry. 0-1 unit. (The Age of Arthur p.27)</characteristic>
